            </note>
            <note corresp="#d231-f2" n="2" xml:id="d231-f2-content">
                <p>Not printed; it quoted telegrams 2191, August 2, and 2219, August 4, from Rome.
                    It is anticipated that these two messages will be printed in <ref
                        target="frus1947v03">volume <hi rendition="#small-caps">iii</hi>
                    </ref>.</p>
            </note>
